
==============================================================================
S672 Paris-Harrington ultrafilter coloring recursion
==============================================================================
HYP-2247.
Interpretation: the metagraph is not the ultrafilter itself; it is a base over which side-choice filters must descend.  Paris-Harrington adds a recursion-theoretic gate: coherent bad side choices cannot keep escaping into the unnamed tail once relative largeness names an initial segment.

