Least forced N for this miniature is 6: bad counts are [1, 2, 6, 18, 12, 0].
At N=4 only the middle edge-count shell e=3 extends; lower/upper shells e=2 and e=4 are dead.  At N=5 the surviving middle shell e=5 has no child.

